 Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌因算力告急限制Gemini API调用，Meta研发进度受阻</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度开源3B参数Unlimited OCR模型，引入R-SWA机制刷新长文档解析纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三星拟在韩国光州扩建先进半导体封装厂以缓解AI芯片产能告急</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">高德地图内测AI编程产品“袋马”，支持分钟级生成微信小程序与iOS应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/abd6e797566119cd87eeba421e7fa9a7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">高德地图正式入局AI零门槛应用生成赛道，目前正低调内测名为“袋马”（daimax）的Vibe Coding产品。该工具主打自然语言驱动，用户无需掌握编程技术或搭建开发环境，仅需通过对话描述需求，即可在分钟级时间内生成可直接上线、真机可用的微信小程序或iOS原生应用。袋马核心服务于无研发团队的中小企业主与独立创作者，支持“对话式修改”与“灵感广场”一键复刻功能，旨在大幅降低创意落地成本。目前产品处于内测阶段，官方尚未披露具体上线时间与商业化细则。随着腾讯、百度、阿里、美团及字节跳动等大厂在AI编程领域的密集布局，高德此次通过聚焦小微主体的轻量化需求切入市场，试图在激烈的竞争中寻找差异化优势。业内分析认为，此类工具的普及正显著降低开发门槛，加速推动全民应用开发时代的到来。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">马斯克宣布Grok4.5开启内测并计划每月推出全新基础模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09656903ecd9ae90ac93424907c5c568.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">埃隆·马斯克于2026年6月28日宣布，xAI旗下最新大语言模型Grok4.5已在SpaceX与特斯拉内部启动Beta测试。该模型基于1.5万亿参数的V9基础模型构建，并深度融合了AI编程工具Cursor的数据，早期评测显示其性能已比肩Anthropic旗舰模型Claude Opus。马斯克同时披露了激进的发布计划，承诺SpaceX在今年剩余时间内将每月推出一个完全从零训练的全新基础模型，旨在通过高频迭代加速技术演进。此次战略布局与SpaceX拟600亿美元收购Anysphere的计划相呼应，预计交易将于2026年三季度完成。通过在SpaceX与特斯拉的实体产业场景中进行高价值反馈测试，xAI正加速深耕企业级AI市场，并重点强化编码辅助能力，此举将进一步加剧与OpenAI及谷歌等头部厂商的竞争态势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌因算力告急限制Gemini API调用，Meta研发进度受阻</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌因Gemini AI平台需求激增，于2026年5月17日正式实施基于算力额度的使用限制，采用滚动更新机制以应对开发者及企业负载压力。自2025年春季以来，Gemini API调用请求量翻倍，导致核心算力资源供不应求。Meta作为受冲击最显著的客户，因其需求远超配额，面临算力供应不足的困境，导致多项内部AI项目推进节奏被打乱。为应对资源限制并配合内部压缩研发成本的战略，Meta已紧急要求员工优化调用流程，提升代码及令牌使用效率。此次事件反映出全球AI算力基础设施建设速度难以匹配爆发式应用需求的严峻现实，对于深度依赖云端算力的厂商而言，如何在资源受限下维持研发速度已成为核心竞争课题。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度开源3B参数Unlimited OCR模型，引入R-SWA机制刷新长文档解析纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b42360a551d2af392abf0b84b34462ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式开源3B参数规模的端到端OCR模型Unlimited OCR，该模型专为书籍、论文等长文档解析场景设计，上线5天GitHub Star即破万。技术层面，Unlimited OCR推理时激活参数约570M，首次引入Reference Sliding Window Attention（R-SWA）机制，打破了传统“逐页解析+拼接”的模式，实现数十页文档的一次性连续解析。该机制将解码阶段的KV Cache控制在恒定规模，有效抑制了显存占用与计算成本随输出长度增长而暴涨的问题。在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中，该模型以93.92%的成绩刷新纪录。实测显示，其推理速度较DeepSeek OCR提升约12.7%，在6000Tokens输出长度下速度优势扩大至35%。该模型的开源为海量文档数字化及大模型</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三星拟在韩国光州扩建先进半导体封装厂以缓解AI芯片产能告急</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三星电子会长李在镕宣布，为应对AI芯片市场持续爆发的需求，公司计划在韩国光州建立全新的先进半导体封装工厂。当前三星产能已无法满足市场需求，此举旨在通过扩产缓解供需瓶颈。在高端存储领域，三星正加大对HBM的投入以追赶SK海力士，并已于今年5月向英伟达、AMD及谷歌等客户提供12层HBM4E内存样品。除半导体封装外，三星还启动了多元化战略扩张，包括在龟尾布局机器人产业、在仁川深耕生物医药、在蔚山投资电池业务以及在釜山布局半导体基板。这一系列投资旨在重塑数字时代硬件供应链，通过多线并进的产业布局，为三星在后AI时代的长期增长构筑核心竞争力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
